    "updated_at": "2021-03-03T07:43:54Z",
    "body": "That seems reasonable, though I realize we do not have any specification with a formal definition of the `contextmenu` event. It would be best to have this language alongside the place that defines when to dispatch it. I would have expected something in https://w3c.github.io/uievents/, but that only mentions it twice, referencing this standard.",
