    "updated_at": "2021-03-09T03:54:02Z",
    "body": "I also found it described as `Fired at elements when the user requests their context menu` in the (non-normative) [Events index](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/indices.html#event-contextmenu) of this spec.\r\n\r\nMaybe I should open an issue on the uievents W3C repository, to document `contextmenu`? Should it also be documented here? I'm not sure how both standards interact and differ.",
